        }
      ],
      "recommendation": "Keep the fixed JavaScript-for-Java-developers topic, but revise o1 to contrast JavaScript's dynamic typing and its Number/BigInt numeric primitives with Java's static numeric types. The page may focus practice on Number while explicitly acknowledging BigInt.",
